\p{补充来源：Bertrand Deroin、Romain Dujardin，\em{Lyapunov exponents for surface groups representations}，[arXiv:1305.0049v2](https://arxiv.org/html/1305.0049v2)，2013-08-02；正式版 \em{Communications in Mathematical Physics} 340 (2015)，433–469，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-015-2469-7)。Tien-Cuong Dinh、Nessim Sibony，\em{Unique ergodicity for foliations in P2 with an invariant curve}，[arXiv:1509.07711v2](https://arxiv.org/html/1509.07711v2)，2017-07-18；正式版 \em{Inventiones mathematicae} 211 (2018)，1–38，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00222-017-0744-2)。}
\p{Frank Loray、Julio C. Rebelo，\em{Minimal, rigid foliations by curves on CPn}，\em{Journal of the European Mathematical Society} 5 (2003)，147–201，[正式 PDF](https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/31506)，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s10097-002-0049-6)。Aurélien Alvarez、Bertrand Deroin，\em{Stabilité structurelle du feuilletage de Jouanolou de degré 2}，[arXiv:2303.09313v1](https://arxiv.org/html/2303.09313v1)，2023-03-16；正式版 \em{Publications Mathématiques de l’IHÉS} 141 (2025)，191–247，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s10240-024-00153-x)。}
